```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Load Shedding Notification</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f6f8;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #1f2937;
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .schedule {
      margin: 25px 0;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .schedule-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }

    .schedule-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .label {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #6b7280;
    }

    .value {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .notice {
      padding: 15px;
      background-color: #fff7ed;
      border-left: 4px solid #f97316;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="header">
      <h1>Load Shedding Notification</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">


      <p>
        This is to inform you that a load shedding schedule has been
        planned for your area.
      </p>

      <div class="schedule">

        <div class="schedule-row">
          <span class="label">Area</span>
          <span class="value"><%= area %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="schedule-row">
          <span class="label">Date</span>
          <span class="value"><%= date %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="schedule-row">
          <span class="label">Start Time</span>
          <span class="value"><%= startTime %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="schedule-row">
          <span class="label">End Time</span>
          <span class="value"><%= endTime %></span>
        </div>

      </div>

      <% if (reason) { %>
        <p>
          <strong>Reason:</strong> <%= reason %>
        </p>
      <% } %>

      <div class="notice">
        Please plan your activities accordingly. Power restoration may
        vary depending on operational conditions.
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">
        We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your
        understanding.
      </p>

      <p>
        Regards,<br />
        <strong>Power Management Authority</strong>
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.
      <br />
      &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Power Management System
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
```
